# Kept out of every image and out of the build context (CHY-85).
#
# Environment files hold credentials. Until 06.11.2026 the deploy copied
# .env.<stage> to pilots/banking/.env before building, and `COPY pilots/banking/`
# put it into the image: every API container carried the superuser's password
# for the database, the one credential role separation exists to keep out of it.
# The containers get their environment from Compose (env_file), never from a
# file inside the image. tests/test_image_contents.py holds this list.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed to build, and large.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
reports
